<main id="main">
    <header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">TIFF reference</p><h1>TIFF is a full document, raster, and image codec.</h1><p class="page-lede">PureJsImage supports broad Classic TIFF and BigTIFF display decoding, native scientific and GeoTIFF rasters, OME-TIFF datasets, Aperio whole-slide pyramids, bounded remote region reads, and structured RGB/RGBA output.</p><div class="page-meta"><span class="pill">Classic TIFF + BigTIFF</span><span class="pill">Strip/tile bounded</span><span class="pill">Node + browser</span></div></div></header>
